Summon a radius 4 storm of all-consuming oblivion at the targeted location for [1, 5, 7, 8, 9 (TL1-5)] turns, reducing those within to nothing. Targets within will take [11, 15, 18, 20, 23 (TL1-5; SP 100)] darkness damage and [11, 15, 18, 20, 23 (TL1-5; SP 100)] temporal damage each turn.  Walls and other terrain within the storm will be disintegrated.

Each time the storm deals damage enemies will have any detrimental magical effect with less than 3 duration set to 3 duration, and all enemy projectiles will be destroyed.

The damage will scale with your Spellpower.
